  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingGainOnSalesOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p style="page-break-before:always; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;※４　固定資産売却益は、主にその他の無形固定資産の売却によるものです。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:14pt;font-size:14pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingGainOnSalesOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock>
